msgid "Before the restore the panel saves its current state into a safety archive with the same password and puts it back if the restore fails. The .env of this panel stays: the secrets are re-encrypted with its key, and the step log names the settings that differ. Afterwards everyone signs in again with the accounts of the archive. Other operations must be over."
